<title>ISRAEL: Nigerian plane intrudes Israel airspace - radio.</title>
<headline>Nigerian plane intrudes Israel airspace - radio.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Nigerian passenger plane intruded into Israeli airspace on Sunday and air force fighters were escorting it to Tel Aviv's Ben-Gurion airport, Israel's Army radio said.</p>
<p>The radio gave no other details. An army spokesman said he no information about the report.</p>
</text>
